OL,3,GNEWSAHead opens school playpark after
OL,4,AMND diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FA head teacher, whose ankle injury
OL,7,Fturned out to be motor neurone disease
OL,8,F(MND), has fulfilled a dream to open an
OL,9,F#89,000 playground at her former
OL,10,Fschool.
OL,12,FClaire Park had to retire from Hartburn
OL,13,FPrimary School in Stockton after being
OL,14,Ftold she has MND, a condition which
OL,15,Fcauses muscle weakness, in January
OL,16,F2025.
OL,18,FHer husband Matthew likened the
OL,19,Fcondition to a game of "whack-a-mole",
OL,20,Fwith new health challenges appearing
OL,21,Fevery day, but said the family remained
OL,22,Fpositive.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
