OL,3,GNEWSAHead opens school playpark after
OL,4,AMND diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer colleagues, friends and
OL,7,Fbusinesses raised more than #100,000 to
OL,8,Fgrant the former head's years-long wish
OL,9,Fto refurbish the playground, and
OL,10,Fprovide funds for the awareness charity
OL,11,Fthe MND Association.
